Note on third-party content

This skill is released under MIT-0. That covers its own original content — the
prose, tooling scripts and templates authored here.

It also documents and quotes material from upstream projects, which carry their
own licenses. Quoted fragments remain under the terms of their originating
project; MIT-0 does not extend to them.

