A note on the AGPL-3.0 source: it is quoted only to document how a specific
pitfall was encountered. Wherever practical its code has been reduced to a
structural description with `file:line` references, and the mechanism behind
each pitfall has been re-sourced to the MIT-licensed DSH sources that define it.
Reuse any remaining fragment under the terms of its originating project.

